SoundTouch 2.3.3 (LGPL 2.1) -- audio time-stretch / resample library.
Project home: https://www.surina.net/soundtouch/

Vendored as a prebuilt linux-x64 binary (include/ + lib/).  Only the C
wrapper API (SoundTouchDLL.h) is consumed; the underlying C++ runtime
is provided by libsoundtouch.so.

Used by src/util/core_audio_stream.c to implement audio_stretch_mode_t
{ Off, Resample, TimeStretch }.

The .so is loaded via -rpath '$ORIGIN/../dep/soundtouch/lib' so
`./build/cupid-ps1` finds it without LD_LIBRARY_PATH.
